### Merchant Onboarding - Delete Merchant (POST soft-delete)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant-onboarding/{{clientId}}/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Merchant Documents - List (latest per type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant-onboarding/{{clientId}}/documents

### Merchant Documents - Upload (multipart: file + documentType)
# documentType: GST | PAN | CIN | MOA | AOA | CANCEL_CHEQUE
# Allowed: PDF, JPEG, JPG, PNG — max 2MB
# VS Code REST Client: use "Send Request" on this block; pick a local file when prompted if supported,
# or use curl:
# curl -X POST "{{baseUrl}}/merchant-onboarding/YOUR_CLIENT_ID/documents/upload" \
#   -F "documentType=GST" \
#   -F "file=@/path/to/gst-certificate.pdf"
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant-onboarding/{{clientId}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FelexeBoundary

------FelexeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

GST
------FelexeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-gst.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample-gst.pdf
------FelexeBoundary--

